@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = replace-with-admin-jwt
@userToken = replace-with-user-jwt
@activeProjectId = 1
@previewProjectId = 2
@missingProjectId = 9223372036854770000
@productId = 10
@variantId = 22
@secondProductId = 11
@unassignedProductId = 999

# Prepare the variables with IDs from the current database. The selected
# Project Products and Promotions can be created through the BE-005/BE-006
# requests before running the quote cases below.

### Active catalogue: current project prices, stock, and category grouping
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preview catalogue for a NOT_STARTED or COMPLETED project
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{previewProjectId}}/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quote: identities and quantities only; prices and totals are server-owned
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":1},{"product_id":{{secondProductId}},"variant_id":null,"quantity":1}]}

### Quote: eligible Promotions choose the highest discount, then lowest promotion_id
# Configure two eligible Promotions with equal discounts before running this case.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":2},{"product_id":{{secondProductId}},"variant_id":null,"quantity":1}]}

### Reject client-supplied price or discount fields (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":1,"unit_price":"0.01"}],"discount":"999.99"}

### Reject a duplicate sellable item (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":1},{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":2}]}

### Reject a non-positive quantity (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":0}]}

### Reject an item not selected in the Project (409 PRODUCT_NOT_SELLABLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{unassignedProductId}},"variant_id":null,"quantity":1}]}

### Reject a stock conflict (409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK with details.items)
# Request more than the current stock for the selected item.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":999999}]}

### Reject a quote for a NOT_STARTED or COMPLETED project (409 PROJECT_NOT_ACTIVE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{previewProjectId}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"product_id":{{productId}},"variant_id":{{variantId}},"quantity":1}]}

### Missing project (404 PROJECT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{missingProjectId}}/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Authorization: omit the bearer token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/pos

### Authorization: an authenticated USER token is forbidden (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{activeProjectId}}/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
